# Hot-Path Safety (.awosignore)

These files are in `.awosignore` — the AWOS worker must not edit them during dogfood runs.

| File | Risk if mid-run edit |
|------|----------------------|
| `orchestrator.py` | Corrupts active loop state |
| `worker.py` | Breaks in-flight edits |
| `awos.py` | CLI/session mismatch |
| `runtime_session.py` | Loses pause/resume state |
| `worktree.py` | Orphans isolated worktrees |

## Rules

- **Minimal diffs** — no drive-by refactors on these files
- **Stop AWOS sessions** before editing locally if testing dogfood
- `orchestrator.py` also loads `awos-orchestrator.mdc` for loop invariants

## After edit

Run targeted tests + relevant `scripts/demo_*.sh` live proof.
